UMD integrates HID vendor filters and device drivers from the OpenMouse
mouse-protocol project (AGPL-3.0 ecosystem; see OpenMouse LICENSE).
UMD × OpenMouse: native UMD drivers for Redragon King Ultra, Rampage
Blitz Ultimate, and related SKUs; OpenMouse-backed detection and control
for additional gaming mice.

